      <h4>Species Facts</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Category: </strong>Reptile</li>
        <li><strong>Scientific name: </strong>Viviparous lizard</li>
        <li><strong>Length: </strong>typically 10&ndash;15cm</li>
        <li><strong>Status: </strong>Common</li>
      </ul>
